* switching_delay is the switching delay of the switch (1us)
* propagation_delay is the propagation delay of the link (1us)
* time_synchronization_error is the time synchronization error (1us)
* payload is the payload size of the flow (in bytes)
* bandwidth is the bandwidth of the link (100Mbps)
* cycle_duration is the cycle duration (50us)
* queue_size is the size of the queue (1500B)

