* bandwidth is the bandwidth of the link (100Mbps)
* Hypercycle is the Hypercycle duration (calculated based on the cycle duration and the number of flows)
* offset is the offset of the flow from the beginning of the cycle (0us)

Note that the WCD calculation assumes that the flow is transmitted at the beginning of each cycle. The confidence score is 0.8, indicating that the calculation is based on the provided information and the assumptions made about the network and the flows.

