The WCD calculation is based on the equation:

WCD = (Hypercycle + switching_delay + propagation_delay + time_synchronization_error) \* (payload / bandwidth)

where:

* Hypercycle is the least common multiple of the cycle durations of all the switches in the path
* switching_delay is the delay introduced by each switch in the path
* propagation_delay is the delay introduced by the physical link between each switch
* time_synchronization_error is the error introduced by the time synchronization mechanism
* payload is the size of the packet being transmitted
* bandwidth is the bandwidth of the link between each switch

